  "scope": "One manual content-origin calibration, independent of PersistentRead observations. A real backend WriteBatch changes a valid account-root BOC after durable commit and before first release, retaining identity/input and all other fields. This is codec-level provenance, not whole-candidate semantic validity or live I13e acceptance. An already released changed same-identity record remains subject to immutable-view rejection.",
